      <title>[PostgreSQL] VACUUM은 도는데 죽은 튜플이 안 줄어들 때</title>
      <link>https://junhkang.com/posts/postgresql-vacuum-3-what-blocks-cleanup/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:15:00 +0900</pubDate>
